    agentflow.orchestrator.turn -> agentflow.orchestrator.turn 'final status Testing: no Planning task, nothing to cancel' {
      notes '''
        **Why this step**

        *Rules › Cancelling*

        > Several changes in one turn: act on the final status only.

        *Rules › Cancelling*

        > Only a status change cancels tasks.

        *Platform*

        > The 20 s debounce merged both status changes into one turn; the prompt lists them and names the final status.

        → Status logic (H6)
      '''
    }
    agentflow.orchestrator.turn -> agentflow.agents.qcAgent 'task_run /qa-run' {
      notes '''
        **Why this step**

